# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TrustStay Layer 1 — public GitHub repo .gitignore
#
# POLICY: This is a PUBLIC repository. Everything that contains verbatim guest
# review text, personal data, or large derived model artefacts is EXCLUDED.
# Only code, configuration, schemas, documentation, tests, dependency pins,
# and safe (text-free) validation/manifest records are committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Review / personal data — NEVER commit to a public repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Full and compact hotel evidence dossiers at the project root (480 files)
# contain verbatim guest review text.
/hotel_*_full.json
/hotel_*_compact.json

# Bundled frozen research sample: raw reviews, ABSA features and MiniLM
# embeddings (contains review text + large arrays). Only the metadata-only
# README and SOURCE_PROVENANCE are kept.
/data/frozen_research_sample/*
!/data/frozen_research_sample/README.md
!/data/frozen_research_sample/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.json

# Full DeBERTa ABSA-refreshed outputs: dossiers, prediction parquet tables,
# checkpoints, batch recovery files, logs, ZIP of dossiers and the smoke test.
# The two text-free validation records are kept.
/outputs/frozen_research_run_full_absa/*
!/outputs/frozen_research_run_full_absa/FULL_ABSA_VALIDATION.md
!/outputs/frozen_research_run_full_absa/ABSA_INFERENCE_PROVENANCE.json
!/outputs/frozen_research_run_full_absa/cluster_invariance_check.json

# Original-run dossiers (review text).
/outputs/frozen_research_run/full_dossiers/
/outputs/frozen_research_run/compact_dossiers/

# per_hotel_diagnostics.json embeds representative review text. The aggregate
# (text-free) diagnostics summary is kept.
/outputs/frozen_research_run/diagnostics/*
!/outputs/frozen_research_run/diagnostics/cluster_diagnostics_summary.json

# Historical Fairmont reference package contains raw review CSV data.
/archive/historical_development/fairmont_reference_package/

# Archive ZIPs (may contain dossiers / review data).
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Safe validation / manifest records (KEEPED — evidence for reproducibility)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept: validation/frozen_sample_validation.json, run_summary.json,
#       dossier_validation.json, execution_record.json,
#       manifests/SUBMISSION_MANIFEST.{json,csv,md}
# (Directory listing patterns below allow those files through while still
#  ignoring the derived .embedding_cache inside validation.)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Derived / cache / environment noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python environments
.venv/
.venv-1/
.venv-full-absa/
env/
venv/
ENV/

# Python caches and build artefacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/

# Derived embedding cache (large binary working file; regenerated by the run)
**/.embedding_cache/

# Logs
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. OS / editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
